[
    [
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.146,
                0.088,
                0.356,
                0.103
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "初三数学核心知识点总结"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.146,
                0.119,
                0.838,
                0.156
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "初三数学知识以代数、几何、统计与概率三大模块为主，是中考的核心考查内容，同时也是对初中前两年知识的整合与深化。以下是分模块的系统总结："
        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "bbox": [
                0.146,
                0.171,
                0.431,
                0.187
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "一、代数模块（中考占比约 \\(40\\%\\)）"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.147,
                0.202,
                0.292,
                0.218
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "1. 一元二次方程"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.176,
                0.233,
                0.813,
                0.27
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "• 定义: 只含一个未知数, 且未知数最高次数为 2 的整式方程, 一般形式为 \\(a x^{2} + b x + c = 0 \\quad (a \\cdot = 0)\\) 。"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.178,
                0.286,
                0.251,
                0.301
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "解法"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.237,
                0.316,
                0.687,
                0.332
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "1. 直接开平方法：适用于 \\((\\mathrm{x} + \\mathrm{m})2 = \\mathrm{n}\\) （ \\(n\\geqslant 0\\) ）的形式。"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.237,
                0.347,
                0.844,
                0.383
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "2. 配方法：通过配方转化为 \\((x + m)2 = n\\) ，步骤为“移项 \\(\\rightarrow\\) 二次项系数化为 \\(1 \\rightarrow\\) 配方 \\(\\rightarrow\\) 开方”。"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.237,
                0.4,
                0.83,
                0.415
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "3. 公式法：求根公式 \\( x = 2a - b \\pm b2 - 4ac \\)，前提是判别式 \\( \\Delta = b2 - 4ac \\geqslant 0 \\)。"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.237,
                0.431,
                0.843,
                0.466
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "4. 因式分解法：适用于方程能分解为 \\((x - x1)(x - x2) = 0\\) 的形式，根为 \\(x1\\)，\\(x2\\)。"
        },
        {
            "type": "list",
            "bbox": [
                0.237,
                0.316,
                0.844,
                0.466
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": null
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.177,
                0.483,
                0.323,
                0.499
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "- 判别式的作用"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.237,
                0.515,
                0.557,
                0.529
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "。 \\(\\Delta > 0\\) ：方程有两个不相等的实数根；"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.237,
                0.545,
                0.538,
                0.559
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\(\\Delta = 0\\) ：方程有两个相等的实数根；"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.237,
                0.577,
                0.622,
                0.591
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "。 \\(\\Delta < 0\\) ：方程无实数根（有两个共轭虚数根）。"
        },
        {
            "type": "list",
            "bbox": [
                0.237,
                0.515,
                0.622,
                0.591
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": null
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.177,
                0.607,
                0.446,
                0.623
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "- 根与系数的关系（韦达定理）"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.146,
                0.638,
                0.755,
                0.654
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "若方程 \\( \\mathrm{ax2 + bx + c = 0} \\) （a·=0）的两根为 \\( \\mathrm{x1,x2} \\)，则 \\( \\mathrm{x1 + x2 = -ab} \\)，\\( \\mathrm{x1x2 = ac} \\)。"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.146,
                0.67,
                0.254,
                0.684
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "2. 二次函数"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.176,
                0.7,
                0.691,
                0.716
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "- 定义：形如 \\( y = ax + bx + c \\) （\\( a \\cdot = 0 \\)）的函数，图像是抛物线。"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.178,
                0.731,
                0.307,
                0.747
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "三种表达式"
        },
        {
            "type": "list",
            "bbox": [
                0.176,
                0.7,
                0.691,
                0.747
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": null
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.237,
                0.762,
                0.529,
                0.777
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "1. 一般式： \\( y = ax + bx + c \\) （\\( a \\cdot = 0 \\)）；"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.237,
                0.793,
                0.836,
                0.829
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "2. 顶点式: \\(y = a(x - h) 2 + k\\) (a \\(\\cdot = 0\\)), 顶点坐标为 \\((h, k)\\), 对称轴为直线 \\(x = h\\);"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.237,
                0.846,
                0.839,
                0.882
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "3. 交点式: \\(y = a(x - x1)(x - x2)\\) (a \\(\\cdot = 0\\)), 其中 \\(x1, x2\\) 是抛物线与 \\(x\\) 轴交点的横坐标。"
        },
        {
            "type": "list",
            "bbox": [
                0.237,
                0.762,
                0.839,
                0.882
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": null
        }
    ],
    [
        {
            "type": "title",
            "bbox": [
                0.177,
                0.087,
                0.307,
                0.104
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "图像与性质"
        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "bbox": [
                0.211,
                0.12,
                0.293,
                0.136
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "系数作用"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.21,
                0.152,
                0.842,
                0.2
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "决定抛物线开口方向: a>0 开口向上; a<0 开口向下\na $ 越大, 开口越窄\n$"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.21,
                0.216,
                0.62,
                0.233
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "共同决定对称轴位置：对称轴为直线 \\(x = -2ab\\)"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.209,
                0.25,
                0.614,
                0.266
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "c 决定抛物线与 \\(\\mathrm{y}\\) 轴交点：交点坐标为 \\((0,\\mathrm{c})\\)"
        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "bbox": [
                0.177,
                0.282,
                0.251,
                0.299
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "- 最值"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.235,
                0.313,
                0.837,
                0.351
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "。当 \\(a > 0\\) 时，抛物线开口向上，在 \\(x = -2ab\\) 处取得最小值 \\(y = 4a4ac - b2\\)"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.237,
                0.366,
                0.837,
                0.402
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "。当 \\(a < 0\\) 时，抛物线开口向下，在 \\(x = -2ab\\) 处取得最大值 \\(y = 4a4ac - b2\\) 。"
        },
        {
            "type": "list",
            "bbox": [
                0.235,
                0.313,
                0.837,
                0.402
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": null
        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "bbox": [
                0.177,
                0.418,
                0.4,
                0.435
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "与一元二次方程的关系"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.146,
                0.449,
                0.779,
                0.466
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "抛物线 \\( y = ax + bx + c \\) 与 \\( x \\) 轴的交点个数对应方程 \\( ax + bx + c = 0 \\) 的实数根个数："
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.237,
                0.481,
                0.422,
                0.495
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "。2个交点 \\(\\Leftrightarrow \\Delta >0\\)"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.237,
                0.512,
                0.569,
                0.526
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "。1个交点（顶点在 \\(\\mathbf{X}\\) 轴上） \\(\\Leftrightarrow \\Delta = 0\\)"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.237,
                0.543,
                0.404,
                0.557
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "无交点 \\(\\Leftrightarrow \\Delta < 0\\)"
        },
        {
            "type": "list",
            "bbox": [
                0.237,
                0.481,
                0.569,
                0.557
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": null
        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "bbox": [
                0.146,
                0.573,
                0.274,
                0.589
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "3. 反比例函数"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.176,
                0.604,
                0.701,
                0.62
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "- 定义：形如 \\( y = x k \\) （\\( k \\cdot = 0, x \\cdot = 0 \\)）的函数，\\( k \\) 为比例系数。"
        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "bbox": [
                0.177,
                0.635,
                0.307,
                0.651
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "图像与性质"
        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "bbox": [
                0.208,
                0.667,
                0.462,
                0.684
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "\\(\\mathrm{k}\\) 的符号图像位置 增减性"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.208,
                0.7,
                0.711,
                0.716
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "k>0 第一、三象限在每个象限内，y随x的增大而减小"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.208,
                0.733,
                0.711,
                0.749
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "k<0 第二、四象限在每个象限内，y随x的增大而增大"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.176,
                0.766,
                0.831,
                0.803
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "- 几何意义: 过反比例函数图像上任意一点作 \\(x\\) 轴、\\(y\\) 轴的垂线, 所得矩形的面积为 \\(|k|\\) 。"
        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "bbox": [
                0.146,
                0.818,
                0.348,
                0.835
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "4. 分式方程与二次根式"
        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "bbox": [
                0.177,
                0.849,
                0.29,
                0.866
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "- 分式方程"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.237,
                0.88,
                0.521,
                0.896
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "1. 定义：分母中含未知数的方程。"
        }
    ],
    [
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.236,
                0.087,
                0.828,
                0.125
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "2. 解法：去分母转化为整式方程 \\(\\rightarrow\\) 解整式方程 \\(\\rightarrow\\) 验根（检验分母是否为0，增根需舍去）。"
        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "bbox": [
                0.177,
                0.14,
                0.289,
                0.156
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "二次根式"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.237,
                0.171,
                0.687,
                0.186
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "1. 有意义的条件：被开方数为非负数，即 a 中 \\(a \\geqslant 0\\)。"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.237,
                0.202,
                0.558,
                0.216
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "2. 性质：(a) \\( 2 = a \\) (a≥0)；a2=|a|。"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.237,
                0.233,
                0.841,
                0.269
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "3. 运算: 加减时先化为最简二次根式, 再合并同类二次根式; 乘除时 \\(a \\cdot b = ab (a \\geqslant 0, b \\geqslant 0)\\), \\(ba = ba (a \\geqslant 0, b > 0)\\) 。"
        },
        {
            "type": "list",
            "bbox": [
                0.237,
                0.171,
                0.841,
                0.269
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": null
        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "bbox": [
                0.146,
                0.285,
                0.431,
                0.302
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "二、几何模块（中考占比约 \\(45\\%\\)）"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.147,
                0.317,
                0.292,
                0.333
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "1. 圆的相关知识"
        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "bbox": [
                0.177,
                0.348,
                0.324,
                0.364
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "圆的基本概念"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.237,
                0.379,
                0.632,
                0.393
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "。圆心：确定圆的位置；半径：确定圆的大小。"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.237,
                0.41,
                0.668,
                0.424
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "。弦：连接圆上两点的线段；直径是圆中最长的弦。"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.237,
                0.441,
                0.668,
                0.455
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "。 弧：圆上两点间的部分，分为优弧、劣弧和半圆。"
        },
        {
            "type": "list",
            "bbox": [
                0.237,
                0.379,
                0.668,
                0.455
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": null
        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "bbox": [
                0.177,
                0.472,
                0.324,
                0.488
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "圆的基本性质"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.146,
                0.503,
                0.767,
                0.517
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "1. 对称性：圆是轴对称、中心对称图形，对称轴是任意一条过圆心的直线。"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.146,
                0.534,
                0.675,
                0.548
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "2. 垂径定理：垂直于弦的直径平分弦，且平分弦所对的两条弧。"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.146,
                0.565,
                0.831,
                0.6
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "3. 圆心角、弧、弦的关系：在同圆或等圆中，相等的圆心角所对的弧相等，所对的弦相等（知一推二）。"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.146,
                0.617,
                0.821,
                0.653
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "4. 圆周角定理: 同弧或等弧所对的圆周角相等, 都等于该弧所对的圆心角的一半;直径所对的圆周角是直角 (90°); 90° 的圆周角所对的弦是直径。"
        },
        {
            "type": "list",
            "bbox": [
                0.146,
                0.503,
                0.831,
                0.653
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": null
        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "bbox": [
                0.177,
                0.669,
                0.418,
                0.685
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "- 点、直线与圆的位置关系"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.146,
                0.701,
                0.54,
                0.715
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "1. 点与圆：设圆半径为 \\(r\\)，点到圆心距离为 \\(d\\)"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.297,
                0.732,
                0.737,
                0.746
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "- \\( \\mathrm{d} < \\mathrm{r} \\rightarrow \\) 点在圆内； \\( \\mathrm{d} = \\mathrm{r} \\rightarrow \\) 点在圆上； \\( \\mathrm{d} > \\mathrm{r} \\rightarrow \\) 点在圆外。"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.146,
                0.762,
                0.261,
                0.777
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "2. 直线与圆"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.297,
                0.793,
                0.728,
                0.808
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "- 相切：直线与圆有且只有一个公共点，此时 \\(d = r\\)；"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.297,
                0.825,
                0.84,
                0.86
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "• 切线的判定：① 定义法；② 到圆心距离等于半径；③ 经过半径外端且垂直于这条半径的直线是圆的切线。"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.297,
                0.877,
                0.692,
                0.891
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "- 切线的性质：圆的切线垂直于过切点的半径。"
        },
        {
            "type": "list",
            "bbox": [
                0.297,
                0.793,
                0.84,
                0.891
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": null
        }
    ],
    [
        {
            "type": "title",
            "bbox": [
                0.177,
                0.088,
                0.289,
                0.104
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "圆的计算"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.146,
                0.118,
                0.637,
                0.134
